'Barbell front squat':['Keep elbows lifted; brace; sit between the hips with control.','Avoid dropping elbows or loading beyond good form.'],
'Barbell strict press':['Brace ribs down; press smoothly; avoid arching your back.','Avoid painful overhead motion, leaning back, or forced reps.'],
'Trap bar deadlift':['Brace; drive through the floor; stand tall without leaning back.','Avoid jerking the weight or rounding the spine.'],
'Romanian deadlift':['Push hips back; keep the bar close; stop before the back rounds.','Avoid turning the hinge into a squat or reaching too low.'],
'Dumbbell Romanian deadlift':['Hinge through the hips; keep dumbbells close; control the lowering.','Avoid rounding the back or forcing depth.'],
'Broad jump':['Swing arms, jump forward, and stick a soft landing.','Avoid stiff landings or repeated maximal attempts when fatigued.'],
'Low box jump':['Jump to a low, stable box; land quietly; step down.','Do not jump off the box or use an unstable surface.'],
